---
args: { decisions: DecisionAtom[], prepared: PreparedEvidence, input: CaseInput }
returns: DraftChangeOption
---
Construct a ChangeOption draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Construct feasible alternatives such as resequencing, substitution, or phased completion within approved design constraints. Obtain exact estimates from authorized services, disclose assumptions, and preserve professional review requirements for structural or safety consequences.
